                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "[ ...] I try to ask the questions for some sort of change of consciousness at some point. It is to plant a seed from a majestic tree. I seek all ways to speed up this change, but it is a structural, cultural, slow change. It will slowly grow and it is already sprouting.\" ",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
